{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7HMdxksLneQ5RHa9aM4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<final_document>\nDear [Hiring Manager's Name],\n\nI'm writing to apply for the Office Manager position at [Practice Name]. For eleven years I was office manager at [Clinic Name], a veterinary clinic with four veterinarians and fourteen staff. I'd welcome the chance to bring that experience to a practice here in [Town].\n\nAt the clinic I handled scheduling and billing for a busy, multi-provider office. In 2014 I managed the clinic's move from paper records to practice management software (AVImark). I also focused on collections: in my last three years there, unpaid invoices over 90 days dropped from about $38,000 to $9,000.\n\nFor the past seven years I cared full-time for my mother, who passed away last spring. During that time I managed her insurance claims and coordinated her appointments with six specialists. Seeing healthcare billing and scheduling from the patient's side taught me how much a clear, organized front office matters to people. I'll bring that understanding to your patients.\n\nI haven't used Dentrix yet. I learned AVImark while moving an entire clinic off paper, and I'm confident I can learn Dentrix quickly. I'm happy to start training before my first day.\n\nI would welcome the chance to discuss how I can support your three dentists and your team. Thank you for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\n[Your Name]\n[Phone] | [Email]\n</final_document>\n\nThe letter is about 230 words. Before you send it:\n\n- **Placeholders:** Fill in the hiring manager's name, the practice name, your old clinic's name, your town and your contact details. If you can't find a name, \"Dear Hiring Manager\" is fine.\n- **Age:** I didn't mention your age. It isn't relevant to the job, and you don't have to share it.\n- **The 7-year gap:** I explained it in one short paragraph and tied it to skills the practice will care about. That's enough. You don't need to explain any further.\n- **Dentrix training:** I wrote that you're happy to start training before your first day. Take that sentence out if you don't want to commit to it.\n- **Supervising staff:** You didn't say whether you directly supervised the 14 people at the clinic, so I only gave the clinic's size. If you did supervise them, add that, because the posting asks for someone to supervise 9 people. For example: \"where I supervised a front-office and support staff of [number].\""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5370,"cache_read_input_tokens":3853,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5370},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ded03f7d-187a-4aa5-ad0a-9c01b9e14748","uuid":"5a6af202-50cf-4039-b776-6f019b6e7b42","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:02:38.518Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7HMdnLDSSwtEVyrBJTi"}
